spice
* SPICE netlist for the given circuit

Vx 2 3 DC 0    * Voltage source Vx
Ix 2 22 DC 0   * Current source Ix

R1 22 3 1k     * Resistor R1 (1k Ohm)
R2 22 VB 1k    * Resistor R2 (1k Ohm)

D1 3 VB D      * Diode D1 with anode at net 3 and cathode at net VB

VB VB 3 DC 0   * Battery VB

.model D D     * Diode model